⍝ ==== s2 compile-time evaluator (spec §13 "eval"), as s1's eval.uh
⍝ The only interpreter in the toolchain: it runs past-tense calls (§9.2) and
⍝ decides prayers (§12) at compile time, and never appears in the output. It
⍝ evaluates pure code over ℤ, ŧ and ◌ of those, keeping integers within 2⁵³
⍝ as s1 does. A value is [ty n ok role hasn] (hasn 0: a failed ◌ or a bare ◌).
⍝ Registers: 49 the first error (a string, −1: none), 50 unwinding a ◌
⍝ failure, 51 steps taken, 52 call depth.

⦃ ⧖:C ⧗:C #49# #-1# ‹wr› #50# ○ ‹wr› #51# ○ ‹wr› #52# ○ ‹wr› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹evnew› ⸫
⍝ ‹everr› C msg: record the first error
⦃
  ⧖:C,msg
  ⧗:C #49# ‹reg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C,msg ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:m #49# ⧗:m ‹wr› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹everr› ⸫
⍝ ‹evstop› C: an error, or a failure unwinding
⦃
  ⧖:C
  ⧗:C #49# ‹reg› ⧖:C,e ⧗:C #50# ‹reg› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⧗:f △ ᛖ ⋏
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evstop› ⸫
⍝ ‹evdie› C tok: report the evaluator's error at tok, if there is one
⦃
  ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C #49# ‹reg› ⧖:C,e
  ⧗:C,tok,e ⧗:e #-1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:tk,m ⧗:tk ‹eerr› ⧗:m ‹spr› ‹die› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧⟩ ‹evdie› ⸫

⍝ ‹evrole› C v role: a copy of value v with that role
⦃
  ⧖:C,v,role
  ⧗:C,v ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ty ⧗:C,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C,v #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ok ⧗:C,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,hn
  ⧗:C ‹len› ⧖:C,w ⧗:C ⧗:ty ⍆̵ ⧗:n ⍆̵ ⧗:ok ⍆̵ ⧗:role ⍆̵ ⧗:hn ⍆̵ ⧗:w
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evrole› ⸫

⍝ ‹evunwrap› C v: ◌T used as T; a failed value starts unwinding (giving −1)
⦃
  ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,v ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,t
  ⧗:C,t ‹efailty› ⧖:C,f ⧗:C,t #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare
  ⧗:C,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C,v #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ok ⧗:C,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,hn
  ○ ⧗:f ‹not› ⧗:bare ⋏ ‹not› ⋔ ∅ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ⁼ ⧗:f ‹not› ⧗:bare ⋏ ‹not› ⧗:ok ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ #2# ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C,v,t,n,hn,k
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃
  #2# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ #50# △ ‹wr› #-1# ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:vv,tt,nn,h ⧗:tt ‹stail› ⧖:bt ⧗:bt,nn,h △ ‹evval› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evunwrap› ⸫
⍝ ‹evunwraps› C L n: every value of L unwrapped (stops early once unwinding)
⦃
  ⧖:C,L,n
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,L,q ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,L,q,i,n
    ⧗:C,L,q,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
      ⦃ ⧖:C,L,q,i,n ⧗:C,L,i ‹lget› ‹evunwrap› ⧖:C,u ⧗:C,q,u ‹qadd› ⧗:L,q ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:q ⌁ ⧗:q ‹qlist›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evunwraps› ⸫

⍝ ---- operators

⍝ ‹evnumv› C t n: [the value n of type t], noting an integer that leaves the exact range
⦃
  ⧖:C,t,n
  ⧗:C,n ⧗:n ‹eexact› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ %%an integer left the exact range of compile-time evaluation (2⁵³)%% ‹everr› ⦄ ⁼
  ⧗:t,n △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evnumv› ⸫
⍝ ‹evglyphv› C x vals: an operator on values; its results (an error leaves them empty)
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,vals
  ⧗:C,vals ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,v0
  ⧗:C,v0 ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,ty ⧗:C,v0 △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,a
  ⧗:C,vals ‹llen› ⧖:C,nv
  ⧗:C,vals ⧗:nv △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ‹lget› △ ‹vf› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ⧖:C,b
  ⧗:C,ty #10# ‹tis› ⧖:C,tr ⧗:C,ty #11# ‹tis› ⧖:C,iz
  ⧗:C,x,ty,a,b ⧗:tr ⧗:iz ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ‹evglyph2› ⦄ ⦃ ‹evnotype› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evglyphv› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,ty,a,b
  ⧗:C,x ‹str1› ⧖:C,xs
  ⧗:C %%compile-time evaluation of {xs} on {ty} is not supported in s1%% ‹everr› ‹lnew0›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evnotype› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,ty,a,b
  ⧗:C,x,ty,a,b ⧗:x
  ⍿⁰ #8862# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q ⧗:t ⧗:p ⧗:q ⊞ ‹evnumv› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8863# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q ⧗:t ⧗:p ⧗:q ⊟ ‹evnumv› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8864# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹evmul› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8856# ᛖ ⍿¹ #8860# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹evdivv› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8861# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q ⧗:t ⧗:p ⊝ △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #9863# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q ⧗:t ⧗:p △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8822# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q #10# ‹reg› ⧖:tt ⧗:tt ⧗:p ⧗:q ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ △ ⦄ ⦃ #-1# ⦄ △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8911# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:xx,t,p,q #10# ‹reg› ⧖:tt ⧗:tt ⧗:p ⧗:q ‹min› △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1› ⦄ ⦃
  #8910# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:xx,t,p,q #10# ‹reg› ⧖:tt ⧗:tt ⧗:p ⧗:q ‹max› △ △ ‹evval› ‹l1› ⦄ ⦃ ‹evnoop› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evglyph2› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,ty,a,b
  ⧗:C,x ‹str1› ⧖:C,xs
  ⧗:C %%compile-time evaluation of {xs} is not supported in s1%% ‹everr› ‹lnew0›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evnoop› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,ty,a,b
  ⧗:C,ty,a,b ⧗:a ⧗:b ‹emulok› ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:t,p,q ⧗:t ⧗:p ⧗:q ⊠ ‹evnumv› ⦄
    ⦃ ⧖:t,p,q %%an integer left the exact range of compile-time evaluation (2⁵³)%% ‹everr› ⧗:t ○ ‹evnumv› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evmul› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,x,ty,a,b
  ⧗:C #9676# ⧗:ty ‹spre› ⧖:C,ft
  ⧗:a ⧗:b ⊘ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:q0 ⧗:a ⧗:b ⊜ ⁇ ⦃ ⦄ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⧖:r0
  ⧗:q0 ⧗:r0 ⧗:x #8860# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖ ⌁ ⧗⁰ ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:q
  ⧗:C,ft,q ⧗:b ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ○ ○ ‹evval› ⦄ ⦃ △ △ ‹evval› ⦄ ⁼ ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evdivv› ⸫

⍝ ---- purity: no I/O, FFI, containers or future calls

⍝ ‹evpure› C nm seen: function nm (and what it calls) can be evaluated
⦃
  ⧖:C,nm,seen
  ⧗:C,seen,nm ‹qhas› ⧖:C,had
  ⧗:C,nm,seen ⧗:had ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ‹evpure1› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpure› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,nm,seen
  ⧗:C,seen,nm ‹qadd›
  ⧗:nm ‹efind› ⧖:C,f
  ⧗:C,f #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,ffi ⧗:C,f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,from ⧗:C,f #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,to
  ⧗:C,from,to,seen ⧗:ffi ○ ᛖ ⧗:from #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹evpureops› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpure1› ⸫
⍝ ‹evpureops› C from to seen
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,seen
  ⧗:C,from,to,seen ⦶
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,i,to,seen,ok
    ⧗:C,i,to,seen,ok ⧗:i ⧗:to ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⧗:ok ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ‹evpure2› ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
  ⦄
  ⧖:C,i,to,seen,ok ⧗:C,ok
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpureops› ⸫
⦃ ⧖:C,i,to,seen,ok ⧗:C,i,seen ‹evpureop› ⧖:C,p ⧗:C,i ‹nextn› ⧖:C,nx ⧗:C,nx,to,seen,p ⊕ ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ŧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpure2› ⸫
⍝ ‹evpureop› C op seen: one op is pure
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,seen
  ⧗:C,op ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C,op ‹ndt› ⧖:C,tok
  ⧗:C,op,seen,tok,k
  ⍿⁰ #5# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o,s,t ⧗:t ‹tc0› ⧖:x ⧗:x ⧖ @any(9113,8961,10199,10198,8982,9032,9076,9030,10996,8859,8857,10204)@ ‹not› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⧖:o,s,t ⧗:t ‹tkd› #12# ᛖ ‹not› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #8# ᛖ ⍿¹ #3# ᛖ ⋏ ⍿¹ #15# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #2# ᛖ ⍿¹ #6# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ‹evpurecall› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #10# #11# ᛦ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ‹evpurefaces› ⦄ ⦃
  ⍿⁰ #14# ᛖ ⍿¹ #7# ᛖ ⋏ ⍿¹ #16# ᛖ ⋏ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:o,s ⧗:o #3# ⊞ ‹brange› ⧖:fr,tt ⧗:fr,tt,s ‹evpureops› ⦄ ⦃
  #17# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ‹evpurehandle› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpureop› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,seen,tok
  ⧗:C,tok #2# ‹tmark› ⧖:C,fut
  ⧗:C,op,seen ⧗:fut ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:o,s ⧗:o ‹eresolve› ‹rd› ⧖:nm ⧗:nm,s ‹evpure› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpurecall› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,seen
  ⧗:C ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ⧖:C,f0 ⧗:C,f0 ‹nextn› ⧖:C,f1 ⧗:C,f1 ‹nextn› ⧖:C,f2
  ⧗:C,f0,seen ‹evpureface› ⧖:C,p0 ⧗:C,f1,seen ‹evpureface› ⧖:C,p1 ⧗:C,f2,seen ‹evpureface› ⧖:C,p2
  ⧗:C ⧗:p0 ⧗:p1 ⋎ ⧗:p2 ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpurefaces› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,seen
  ⧗:C,f ○ ‹nd› ⧖:C,k
  ⧗:C,f,seen ⧗:k #9# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:ff,s ⧗:ff ‹brange› ⧗:s ‹evpureops› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpureface› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,op,seen,tok
  ⧗:C ⧗:op #3# ⊞ ⧖:C,okb ⧗:C,okb ‹nextn› ⧖:C,fb
  ⧗:C,okb,seen ‹evpureface› ⧖:C,p1 ⧗:C,fb,seen ‹evpureface› ⧖:C,p2
  ⧗:C ⧗:p1 ⧗:p2 ⋎
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ŧ⟩ ‹evpurehandle› ⸫

⍝ ---- calls and blocks

⍝ ‹evcall› C f args: call the function with emit record f; its output values
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,args
  ⧗:C #52# ‹inc› △ ⊞ ⧖:C,d
  ⧗:C,f,args ⧗:d #200# ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ‹evcall1› ⦄ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ %%compile-time evaluation recursed more than 200 calls deep%% ‹everr› ‹lnew0› ⦄ ⦃ ‹evcall1› ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evcall› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,f,args
  ⧗:C,f #5# ‹vf› ⧖:C,from ⧗:C,f #6# ‹vf› ⧖:C,to
  ⧗:C,from,to,args ‹evblock› ⧖:C,S
  ⧗:C #52# ‹reg› ⧖:C,d ⧗:C #52# ⧗:d △ ⊟ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,f #3# ‹vf› #2# ‹vf› ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C #49# ‹reg› ⧖:C,err ⧗:C #50# ‹reg› ⧖:C,fail
  #2# ⧗:fail △ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ △ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧗:err #-1# ᛖ ‹not› ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ○ ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⧖:k
  ⧗:C,S,outs,k ⍿⁰ ○ ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ‹lnew0› ⦄ ⦃ #1# ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:SS,oo ⧗:oo ‹evfailed› ⦄ ⦃ ‹evouts› ⦄ ⁼ ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evcall1› ⸫
⍝ the function failed: its single ◌ output carries the failure
⦃
  ⧖:C,outs
  ⧗:C #50# ○ ‹wr› ⧖:C
  ⧗:C,outs ○ ‹lget› ⧖:C,o
  ⧗:C,o ○ ○ ○ ‹evval› ‹l1›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evfailed› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,outs
  ⧗:C ‹qnew› ⧖:C,q
  ⧗:C,S ‹llen› ⧖:C,ns
  ⧗:C,outs ‹llen› ⧖:C,n
  ⧗:C,S,outs,q,ns ○ ⧗:n
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:C,S,outs,q,ns,i,n
    ⧗:C,S,outs,q,ns,i,n ⧗:i ⧗:n ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⁼ ⦃ ‹evout1› ⊕ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⧖:q ⌁ ⌁ ⧗:q ‹qlist›
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evouts› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,outs,q,ns,i,n
  ⧗:C,outs,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,o
  ⧗:C,o #15# ‹tis› ⧖:C,bare
  ⧗:C,S,i,o ⧗:bare ⧗:ns ○ ᛖ ⋎ ⋔ ⦃ ⧖:SS,ii,oo ⧗:oo ○ ○ △ ‹evval› ⦄ ⦃ ‹evout2› ⦄ ⁼ ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,q,v ‹qadd›
  ⧗:S,outs,q,ns ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⧗:n
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ ℤ⟩ ‹evout1› ⸫
⦃
  ⧖:C,S,i,o
  ⧗:C,S,i ‹lget› ⧖:C,v
  ⧗:C,v ○ ‹vf› ⧖:C,vt ⧗:C,v △ ‹vf› ⧖:C,n ⧗:C,v #4# ‹vf› ⧖:C,hn
  ⧗:C,v,o,n,hn ⧗:o ⧗:vt ᛖ ⋔ ⦃ ⌁ ⌁ ⌁ ⦄ ⦃ ⧖:vv,oo,nn,h ⧗:oo,nn,h △ ‹evval› ⦄ ⁼
⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evout2› ⸫

⍝ ‹evblockn› C b S: ‹evblock› on block node b
⦃ ⧖:C,b,S ⧗:C,b ‹brange› ⧖:C,from,to ⧗:C,from,to,S ‹evblock› ⦄ ⟨⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ ℤ ⊸ ⟦ℤ⟧ ℤ⟩ ‹evblockn› ⸫
⍝ ‹evblock› C from to S: run the ops over S (a fresh strand), giving the final stack
⦃
  ⧖:C,from,to,S
